  "group_descriptions": {
    "*** Trust matrix ***": "Trust matrix:\nHigh: Confirmed by multiple credible and independent sources.\nMedium: Plausible with partial corroboration or one strong source.\nLow: Single-source, weakly supported, conflicting, or unconfirmed.",
    "*** Violent act ***": "Violent act:\nForce used against people. Method only — shooter, weapon, vehicle, hostage. Motive is set under Impact / Motive.",
    "*** Accident / failure ***": "Accident / failure:\nA human system failed or the cause is not known. Plant explosion, hazmat, infrastructure or dam failure. Do not call it an attack unless that is known.",
    "*** Device ***": "Device:\nA physical device, fire, or hazardous material used as the mechanism. Includes bombs, drones, arson, and chemical or radiological releases.",
    "*** Cyber ***": "Cyber:\nA network, data, or communications attack. Includes cyberattack, ransomware, and jamming."
  },
